@startuml

hide footbox
title US023 - To get the list of items on direct sale of a given publication

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

' Buyer -> System : **1** getListOfItems(typeOfSale, publication)
Buyer -> System : **1** I want to get a list of items on direct sale of a given publication
Buyer <-- System : **2** Which publication? Choose!
Buyer -> System : **3** publication

System --> Buyer : **4** List of items on direct sale

@enduml